    content: `"Every notebook gifted is a new chapter written in their future.\nOn account of our Charter Day, We, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore proudly conducted "EquipEd" on 5th October 2024 under #ThePlusTwoSaga, an initiative aimed at making a tangible impact on the students of Panchayat Union Middle School, Vadavalli, Coimbatore.This event, emphasized the significance of education and how access to basic stationery can greatly enhance a child's learning experience. The simple distribution of notebooks, pencils, and other essential supplies opens doors to knowledge, creativity, and confidence. By providing these children with the necessary resources, we have created opportunities that will foster growth and learning for years to come, taking one step closer toward building a stronger and more educated community.`,
