    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Eduvista.png',
    content: `"Believe that every student deserves to reach their full potential, and education is the key to unlocking that potential."\nWe, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, proudly organized the event Eduvista, an enlightening experience for school students! On 28/10/2024, we welcomed enthusiastic students to Government College of Technology, Coimbatore, for a day of discovery and exploration, demystifying engineering streams and career paths, and offering insights into campus life and college experiences. Our goal was to inspire young minds to pursue their passions.\nTogether, let's empower the next generation to make informed choices and shape their futures!`,
