    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Voice 4.png',
    content: `"Be a voice, not an echo; let your actions be known."\nTo emphasize their thoughts about society as well as their rights, we, the Rotaract Club of GCT, Coimbatore, organized the event "Voice IV" on 28/10/24.\nThe topic was "Are CSR initiatives impactful, or are they just used to improve brand image?" The event not only encouraged participants to actively debate but also improved their speaking skills, critical thinking, and fostered their thoughts and rights regarding persistent societal issues.`,
