    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Impression.png',
    content: `"An interview isn’t just about answers—it’s about leaving an unforgettable impression."\nTo prepare participants to excel in interviews and hone their personal branding, we, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, conducted the event "Impression" on 29/10/2024. This session was handled by Rtr. PP. Tharshini, Certified District Trainer. The participants learned valuable tips and tricks for confidently navigating interviews and making lasting impressions. This event was an incredible opportunity for members and aspiring leaders to gain skills that pave the way for their future success.`,
