    tenure: '2024-25',
    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Eduvate.png',
    content: `"Unlocking potential through the power of education!"\nIn the spirit of nurturing young potential, We, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, proudly launched "EDUVATE", a year-long educational initiative aimed at supporting students from 7th to 12th grade. The first session took place on 10/11/24 at Gokulam Ashramam, Vadavalli.Through consistent weekly sessions, Eduvate strives to foster academic excellence, instill confidence, and build self-esteem in young learners, preparing them for a brighter future.\nLet's join hands in making a meaningful impact on their educational journey.`,
