    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Aignite.png',
    content: `"Productivity soars when technology and creativity unite."\nOn 14th November 2024, We, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, hosted AIGNITE, a session on AI for Productivity and Innovation, led by Rtr. Subash, Certified District Trainer. The session offered participants hands-on insights into leveraging AI platforms like ChatGPT and other tools to enhance workflows and spark creativity.Attendees explored practical applications of AI in real-world scenarios, discovering how these tools can drive development, streamline tasks, and elevate everyday efficiency. This enriching session empowered participants to integrate AI into their personal and professional lives, opening doors to innovation and productivity.`,
