    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Maatram.png',
    content: `"Drama isn’t just about acting—it’s about conveying powerful messages and sparking change."\nTo inspire creativity, teamwork, and social awareness, we, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, conducted the event "Maatram" on 19/11/2024 and 20/11/2024. This two-day event encouraged participants to address pressing social issues through the art of drama.Guided by rounds like Navarasa Nayagan, Sangavi Annanuku Nalla Seat Edu, and Athu Naanu Athu Naanu, the teams crafted impactful scripts, rehearsed, and performed. The event celebrated creativity and highlighted crucial social topics. It was an excellent platform for participants to showcase their talents while fostering social responsibility.`,
