    content: `To explore the power of Public Relations (PR) in building meaningful connections and driving growth, We, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, proudly conducted an enlightening session PRism on 25/11/2024.The session, led by Rtr. Vinmitha, District Trainer Designate, shed light on the art and science of PR, emphasizing its role in personal and professional growth. Participants were equipped with tools to master storytelling, engage audiences effectively, and build strong personal and professional brands through strategic social media use.This insightful session not only inspired creativity but also empowered participants to craft impactful messages, shape perceptions, and leverage PR as a tool for transformation.`,
