    content: `The Rotary Club of Coimbatore East hosted a sports meet "Rotary East Family Sports meet" for the sister clubs to promote fellowship and friendship between Rotarians and Rotaractors in the long run.\nThe event held on 24th November included games like badminton, cricket and throwball. The winners were awarded with medals and certificates encouraging their sportsmanship.`,
