    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Protact.png',
    content: `"Prioritizing safety, enabling performance!"\nIn our commitment to foster both safety and excellence in sports, We, The Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, proudly organized the event "ProTact" under the District Priority Project on 30.11.2024 at Gokulam Ashramam, Vadavalli, Coimbatore.The initiative focused on equipping young athletes with knee pads, first aid kits, and bandages to ensure their safety during sports activities. To enhance preparedness, a live demo session was conducted, teaching students how to use the kits effectively during injuries or emergencies.\nTogether, let’s nurture safe play and promote sportsmanship among the youth!`,
