    content: `ADVENTOUR 2025 was a two-day trip to Munnar and Cochin, aimed at strengthening board members' bonds and creating unforgettable memories. The journey began in Cochin, where participants explored historic colonies and enjoyed a vibrant DJ boat ride. In Munnar, they explored scenic dams and boating activities. The trip was filled with excitement, camaraderie, and heartfelt conversations, leaving everyone with cherished memories and stronger friendships.`,
