    tenure: '2024-25',
    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Water drop.png',
    content: `"Every drop counts, and we made it matter!"\nTo ensure the availability of clean and healthy water in our GCT hostel and to raise awareness on water hygiene, We, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore, organised 'Water Drop' on 25/03/2024.\nThis event offered free inspection, expert consultations, and filter repair services. The Pure Flow Water Purifier Service Camp concluded successfully by delivering top-notch maintenance and servicing for commercial water purifiers, ensuring safe water access for all.`,
