    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Mashup memories.png',
    content: `"Revisiting the Past, Embracing the Future"\nOn 25th March 2025, the Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore hosted Mashup Memories — a lively Club Service event to celebrate unity and strengthen bonds among Rotaractors. From nostalgic glimpses in Memory Lane and heartfelt notes in Words for you, blending fun, gratitude, and nostalgia, Mashup Memories beautifully celebrated our shared journey.`,
