    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Scholar sphere.png',
    content: `Scholar Sphere, led by gSARC General Secretary Ms. Movisha M S, aimed to bridge the gap between students and academic advancement opportunities. The session focused on scholarships and internships for engineering students, focusing on real-life experiences, success stories, and key platforms. Targeting second and pre-final year students, it boosted awareness, built confidence, and inspired personal growth and academic excellence.`,
