    tenure: '2024-25',
    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/FIRE TO FRIENDSHIP.png',
    content: `The Rotaract Club of GCT Coimbatore organized Fire to Friendship, a platform for fostering harmony and understanding among diverse individuals. The event included interactive sessions, team-building activities, and open discussions, promoting open communication and misunderstanding resolution. Participants developed stronger interpersonal skills, trust, and bonds, fostering a sense of unity and inclusivity.`,
