    tenure: '2024-25',
    picture: '/images/projects/Projects 24-25/Karkai.png',
    content: `The கற்கை initiative was a community outreach program aimed at promoting education among Ukkaiyanur children. It introduced them to career paths after 10th grade, competitive examinations, scholarships, counselling services, and TFC centers. The event bridged the information gap and inspired students to pursue higher education. It sparked lasting change, empowering them with knowledge and confidence to envision a brighter future.`,
