    content: `Nambikai Noolagam was an initiative by Anugraha Charity to empower physically challenged individuals with accessible knowledge. A curated collection of 60 books was set up, fostering curiosity and a lifelong love for learning. The event demonstrated the transformative power of community-driven service, highlighting the importance of overcoming physical limitations and fostering hope and growth through empathy.`,
